he title.  \n6. Include cinematic-style credits at the bottom, featuring fictional names for directors, producers, and cast members.  \n7. Add a review quote near the top, such as \"‘一场毛茸茸的动作冒险！’ - 动作电影评论家\".  \n8. Overlay subtle motion blur streaks or debris effects around the dog to emphasize action and movement.  \n9. Insert a release date at the bottom center, using bold font with a metallic sheen effect.  \n10. Add a fake movie studio logo in the corner for authenticity.  \n```"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 6, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [365.9155578613281, 228.53070068359375], "pos": [923.1934204101562, -156.71739196777344], "widgets_values": ["", "You are a creative prompt engineer. Your mission is to analyze the provided image and generate exactly 1 distinct image transformation *instructions*.\nThe Brief:Create a movie poster with the subjects of this image as the main characters. Take a random genre (action, comedy, horror, etc) and make it look like a movie poster. Sometimes, the user would provide a title for the movie (not always). In this case the user provided: . Otherwise, you can make up a title based on the image. If a title is provided, try to fit the scene to the title, otherwise get inspired by elements of the image to make up a movie. Make sure the title is stylized and add some taglines too. Add lots of text like quotes and other text we typically see in movie posters.\nYour response must consist of concise instruction ready for the image editing AI. Do not add any conversational text, explanations, or deviations; only the instructions."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 32, "